WEBVTT

00:21:27.848 --> 00:21:31.186
and so you find yourself
with people debating

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:32.395
what the right way is,

00:21:32.419 --> 00:21:36.370
not even, again, knowing
what the source of that thing was.

00:21:36.394 --> 00:21:39.061
And so I think the combination
of a strong culture,

00:21:39.085 --> 00:21:44.235
high growth and high speed
make for some really interesting times.

00:21:44.259 --> 00:21:46.957
AG: What's a WeWork
example of the pot roast?

00:21:47.594 --> 00:21:51.446
DF: This foggy vinyl on the glass.

00:21:51.470 --> 00:21:53.887
You know, a lot of members
would want privacy,

00:21:53.911 --> 00:21:57.872
and they would want
to put some translucency

00:21:57.896 --> 00:21:59.980
on the glass in the buildings